Package: tts.api
Title: OpenAI-Compatible Text-to-Speech API Client
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "troy@cornball.ai")
Description: An R client for Text-to-Speech APIs supporting multiple backends:
    OpenAI-compatible APIs (OpenAI, Chatterbox, LM Studio, OpenWebUI, AnythingLLM)
    and ElevenLabs. Provides a unified interface for speech synthesis with
    backend-specific parameters.
